p:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：以中间碳为对称中心 ⇒ 1 位与 5 位、2 位与 4 位分别等价，共 <strong>3 种</strong>（1-位、2-位、3-位）⇒ 一氯代物 <strong>3 种</strong>；</li>\n<li><strong>新戊烷</strong> <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{C(CH_3)_4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：4 个甲基完全等价 ⇒ 等效氢 1 种 ⇒ 一氯代物 <strong>1 种</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>最多的是正戊烷，选 <strong>C</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>&quot;画链找重影&quot;</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>把碳链画出来，找对称（看&quot;重影&quot;）：<strong>两边翻对折、中间轴对称</strong>；同一碳上的甲基合并算一种；最后有几种&quot;位置碳&quot;，一氯代物就有几种。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>为什么</strong>：一氯代物数 = 等效氢种数——因为取代任意一个等效氢得到的分子完全相同（把分子旋转/翻面后即重合），只有&quot;位置不同&quot;的氯才算新结构。</p>\n<p>30 秒数出来：A=2，B=2，C=3，D=1 → C。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"光照条件下，将下列各 0.1 mol 烃分别与足量 C l 2 \\mathrm{Cl_2} C l 2 ​ 反应（只考虑一氯取代），生成的一氯代物数目最多的是（ ） A. 正丁烷 B. 异丁烷 C. 正戊烷 D. 新戊烷 对称性结论快速记忆","source":"自编（经典考法：等效氢法数一元取代物，选填高频）","difficulty":"容易","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"等效氢的判断标准是\"化学环境相同\"——对称（镜像/旋转）等价、同一碳上的甲基氢等价；数替代物时每种等效氢对应一种一氯代物，但取代相同位置的不同氢得到同一化合物（不重复计数）。光照条件用 Cl₂ 取代，需数的是\"一氯代物\"不是\"二氯代物\"。","fit":["一氯代物（烷烃+Cl₂ 光照）","等效氢判断（对称性）","选填题"],"updated":"Mon Mar 03 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"chemistry","title":"化学"},{"slug":"organic","title":"有机化学基础"},{"slug":"inference","title":"有机推断与合成"},{"slug":"equivalent-h","title":"等效氢法·一氯代物数目比较"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"aromatic-isomer-inference","title":"芳香族同分异构（银镜+水解=甲酸酯）","type":"example"},{"slug":"flow-template","title":"有机推断大题·醇醛酸酯链（模板）","type":"example"},{"slug":"isomer-count","title":"同分异构体数（基元法）","type":"example"},{"slug":"organic-flow-inference","title":"有机流程推断（连续氧化链定位）","type":"example"},{"slug":"organic-inference-demo","title":"有机推断（特征反应定位）","type":"example"},{"slug":"organic-inference","title":"有机推断与合成","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"synthesis-route","title":"乙烯